  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This work studies the impact of climate change on black spruce colonisation of snow beds near tree line. The recent increase of temperature can favor earlier melting and opening of snow beds. These areas are generally covered by herbaceous plants and small shrubs and their colonisation by black spruce may lead to the densification of forest cover in the forest-tundra transition zone."
